{"id":"27f0933c8a8be85d","group":"58","path":"58/batch06/58-df-zfc-ideal6-selective-ideal.md","title":"ZFC Ideal6 Selective Ideal","display":"df-zfc-ideal6-selective-ideal — ZFC Ideal6 Selective Ideal","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-zfc-ideal6-selective-ideal","aliases":["58-df-zfc-ideal6-selective-ideal"],"display":"df-zfc-ideal6-selective-ideal — ZFC Ideal6 Selective Ideal","depends_on":["[[58-ax-zfc]]","[[58-df-function]]","[[58-df-ideal]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-zfc-ideal6-selective-ideal"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-zfc-ideal6-selective-ideal</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-zfc-ideal6-selective-ideal — ZFC Ideal6 Selective Ideal"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" href=\"?note=a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" title=\"58-ax-zfc\">58-ax-zfc</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"58-df-function\">58-df-function</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"6e4f95381faac4f9\" href=\"?note=6e4f95381faac4f9\" title=\"58-df-ideal\">58-df-ideal</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S\">\\(S\\)</span> (ambient formal setting)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal I,A,B,f\\in V\">\\(\\mathcal I,A,B,f\\in V\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Ideal}\">\\(\\mathrm{Ideal}\\)</span> (ideal predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"6e4f95381faac4f9\" href=\"?note=6e4f95381faac4f9\" title=\"58-df-ideal\">58-df-ideal</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Function}\">\\(\\mathrm{Function}\\)</span> (set-function predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"58-df-function\">58-df-function</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcIdeal6SelectiveIdeal}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcIdeal6SelectiveIdeal}_S\\)</span> (predicate defined here)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}ideal6\\text{-}selective\\text{-}ideal} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcIdeal6SelectiveIdeal}_S(\\mathcal I)\\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{Ideal}(\\mathcal I,\\mathcal P(\\omega))\\land\\forall A\\subseteq\\omega\\;\\Bigl(A\\notin\\mathcal I\\to\\forall f\\;\\bigl(\\mathrm{Function}(f,A,\\omega)\\to\\exists B\\subseteq A\\;(B\\notin\\mathcal I\\land((\\forall x,y\\in B\\;f(x)=f(y))\\lor(\\forall x,y\\in B\\;(f(x)=f(y)\\to x=y))))\\bigr)\\Bigr)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}ideal6\\text{-}selective\\text{-}ideal} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcIdeal6SelectiveIdeal}_S(\\mathcal I)\\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{Ideal}(\\mathcal I,\\mathcal P(\\omega))\\land\\forall A\\subseteq\\omega\\;\\Bigl(A\\notin\\mathcal I\\to\\forall f\\;\\bigl(\\mathrm{Function}(f,A,\\omega)\\to\\exists B\\subseteq A\\;(B\\notin\\mathcal I\\land((\\forall x,y\\in B\\;f(x)=f(y))\\lor(\\forall x,y\\in B\\;(f(x)=f(y)\\to x=y))))\\bigr)\\Bigr)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Every function on an ideal-positive set is constant or injective on a further ideal-positive subset.</li>\n<li>The ideal carrier is <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal P(\\omega)\">\\(\\mathcal P(\\omega)\\)</span>, not <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\omega\">\\(\\omega\\)</span> itself, and functions are represented by typed graphs.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"58-ax-zfc","status":"resolved","id":"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-ax-zfc]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-function","status":"resolved","id":"36d7463d215be751","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-function]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-ideal","status":"resolved","id":"6e4f95381faac4f9","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-ideal]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-ideal","status":"resolved","id":"6e4f95381faac4f9","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Ideal}$ (ideal predicate, see [[58-df-ideal]])","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-function","status":"resolved","id":"36d7463d215be751","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Function}$ (set-function predicate, see [[58-df-function]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal I,A,B,f\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Ideal}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Function}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcIdeal6SelectiveIdeal}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}ideal6\\text{-}selective\\text{-}ideal} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcIdeal6SelectiveIdeal}_S(\\mathcal I)\\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{Ideal}(\\mathcal I,\\mathcal P(\\omega))\\land\\forall A\\subseteq\\omega\\;\\Bigl(A\\notin\\mathcal I\\to\\forall f\\;\\bigl(\\mathrm{Function}(f,A,\\omega)\\to\\exists B\\subseteq A\\;(B\\notin\\mathcal I\\land((\\forall x,y\\in B\\;f(x)=f(y))\\lor(\\forall x,y\\in B\\;(f(x)=f(y)\\to x=y))))\\bigr)\\Bigr)","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathcal P(\\omega)","display":false},{"tex":"\\omega","display":false}],"bytes":1296,"backlinks":[{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-2297","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch06/58-df-zfc-ideal6-selective-ideal.md|58-df-zfc-ideal6-selective-ideal]]（batch06）"}],"outgoing":["a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","36d7463d215be751","6e4f95381faac4f9"]}